BO5 is an abbreviation of "'''Best of five'''" which is a common [[QuakeWorld]] match format meaning that the team/player who is able to win 3 maps out of 5 first, is the winner of the match. Best of five match format is more often seen to be used in the playoffs and grand finals of [[QuakeWorld]] tournaments and leagues.

For example [[European Quake League]] and [[Nations Quake Rank]] are known for using this match format for their playoffs and grand final games.

